  "title": "Repeat organic Java example 359 on the factory verifier",
  "description": "Run the original native and finite JVM contracts on the same checker revision as the Avro factory proof, retaining its successes, refutations and first refusals. Check each admitted selector against the original bytecode and repeat the parent witness so all applicable obligations can be recounted at this exact checker.",
  "kind": "real-world",
  "capabilities": [
    "jvmcontract:prove"
  ],
  "links": {
